{"file": "穿越六零之我在山洞闷声发家-第41集.mp4", "ep": 41, "duration": 58.2, "segments": [{"start": 2.7, "end": 3.42, "text": "有"}, {"start": 3.94, "end": 5.54, "text": "这东西千万别给别人看"}, {"start": 6.27, "end": 6.87, "text": "两天"}, {"start": 7.19, "end": 8.03, "text": "最多两天"}, {"start": 8.35, "end": 9.15, "text": "我给你消息"}, {"start": 9.79, "end": 10.19, "text": "成"}, {"start": 10.51, "end": 11.15, "text": "等你消息"}, {"start": 13.42, "end": 15.14, "text": "老虎果然是重磅炸弹"}, {"start": 15.58, "end": 17.06, "text": "就看高建设背后的人"}, {"start": 17.3, "end": 18.18, "text": "能开什么价"}, {"start": 26.1, "end": 26.62, "text": "行了"}, {"start": 26.98, "end": 27.74, "text": "知道你乖"}, {"start": 28.26, "end": 28.94, "text": "有钱"}, {"start": 29.18, "end": 29.82, "text": "有粮"}, {"start": 29.98, "end": 30.58, "text": "有菜"}, {"start": 30.78, "end": 31.34, "text": "有鱼"}, {"start": 31.9, "end": 33.26, "text": "家也越来越像家了"}, {"start": 33.97, "end": 34.93, "text": "等老虎出手"}, {"start": 35.17, "end": 36.09, "text": "盖房子的事"}, {"start": 36.21, "end": 37.25, "text": "就能提上日程"}, {"start": 37.49, "end": 42.11, "text": "你个白眼狼"}, {"start": 42.11, "end": 43.05, "text": "给老娘出来"}, {"start": 43.05, "end": 44.37, "text": "我们老秦家的人都来了"}, {"start": 44.37, "end": 45.21, "text": "你敢不开门"}, {"start": 45.21, "end": 45.77, "text": "逆子"}, {"start": 45.85, "end": 46.33, "text": "开门"}, {"start": 46.45, "end": 47.85, "text": "听说你打猎弄了好东西"}, {"start": 47.97, "end": 48.65, "text": "自己吃毒食"}, {"start": 48.65, "end": 49.65, "text": "不知道孝敬长辈"}, {"start": 49.65, "end": 50.05, "text": "咋"}, {"start": 50.05, "end": 50.73, "text": "把门砸开"}]}